# Play test of Storm Spire (CIPlay storm_spire, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the landing on the
# west beach (3 m) with the shed and the tapes, the lift tower at the needle's west foot (its pad 9.5 m, ladders from
# 9.5, 15.5, 21.5 and 27.5 m, the landing 21.5 m, the top 33.5 m), the bridge to the station (33.5 m), the north cove
# (3.8 m down). Walks and stands on Raft's floor blocks start off their seams (a ray down slips between two blocks).
island Storm Spire
expect step 0
expect title Eye of the Storm
wait 5

# The landing: the tapes, the shed's rod
walk -42 4 to -36.5 4 to -31 4.5 to -31 8 h=3
zone spirefoot
expect step 0
walk -32 8 to -30.9 8.9 h=3
read Meteorologist's tapes
expect step 1
walk -31 7.75 to -33 7.75 to -34.2 7.6 h=3.2 below=5
open Shed box
expect story rod 1

# Up the lift tower: the landing's rod halfway, then the top and the bridge to the station - and the storm bird
walk -32 8 to -20 8.5 to -13.4 9 h=9.5
climb -12.45 9 h=9.5
climb -12.45 9 h=15.5
expect stand -11.5 8.45 h=21.5 below=24
open Landing box
expect story rod 2
climb -12.45 9 h=21.5
climb -12.45 9 h=27.5
expect stand -10.6 8.4 h=33.5 below=36
walk -10.2 9.3 to -6 9.3 to -2.6 9.3 h=33.5
zone spiretop
expect step 2
kill Screecher
expect step 3

# The north cove: the third rod on its floor (the cove's box, then all three rods); then the station's locker
at -30 56 h=-2.2
open Cove box
expect story rod 3
expect step 5
at 2.9 10.6 h=34.6
open Station locker
wait 4
expect story rod 0
expect item Blueprint_SmelterElectric 1
expect done
